# Local first-run workarounds (MVP-7.3 P7): a root-level certs/ dir and a
# docker-compose.override.yml are local-only and must never be committed.
# /certs is anchored to the repo root — docker/certs/ (official Russian
# Trusted CA certificates for the backend image) stays tracked.
/certs/
docker-compose.override.yml

